        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ashley Judd, Naomi Judd, Wynonna Judd, Tommy Lee Jones, Bruce Greenwood, Bruce Beresford, Annabeth Gish\n- Works: Double Jeopardy, The Last Supper\n- Topics: Acting careers, political activism, humanitarian efforts, family background\n\nFacts:\n- Ashley Judd was born Ashley Tyler Ciminella on April 19, 1968, and she is an American actress and political activist.\n- Ashley Judd is the daughter of country music singer Naomi Judd and the sister of Wynonna Judd, and she grew up in a family of successful performing artists.\n- Ashley Judd is best known for an acting career spanning more than two decades, and she later became increasingly involved in global humanitarian efforts and political activism.\n- Double Jeopardy is a 1999 American neo noir adventure crime thriller film directed by Bruce Beresford.\n- Double Jeopardy stars Tommy Lee Jones, Ashley Judd, and Bruce Greenwood.\n- Annabeth Gish is associated with The Last Supper and Double Jeopardy.",
